T\r\n    @Produces(MediaType.TEXT_PLAIN)\r\n    @Retry(maxRetries = 1)\r\n    @Fallback(RecoverFallback.class)\r\n    public String faultTolerance() {\r\n        maybeFail();\r\n        return \"Hurrah\";\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut the fallback is never executed. Doing the same but with `fallbackMethod` property then it works as expected.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"dmlloyd","id":124581,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDU4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124581?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd","html_url":"https://github.com/dmlloyd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/2344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/2344/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}